% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% expect-output: /limitcheck
% Scenario: nesting deeper than the limit is a limitcheck at scan time.
% Expect: prints "/limitcheck".
/prog 2002 string def
0 1 1000 { prog exch 123 put } for      % 1001 "{" bytes
1001 1 2001 { prog exch 125 put } for   % 1001 "}" bytes
{ prog cvx exec } stopped pop
$error /errorname get ==
